<!-- The mirror of ic_rotate_right — iOS SF Symbol "rotate.left". Same rounded square with a
     curved corner arrow, flipped horizontally so the arrow sits at the top-right and turns the
     other way; shown while in landscape so the button reads as "turn back". -->
